    {
      "text": "题为“Folio lifecycle — one cycle, plan to retire”的六条水平泳道 BPMN 图。Programme manager：Folio initiative（开始）、Plan scope, team, artifacts [content-plan]。Work plan — beans（人类与智能体共享）：Seed the work plan [todo-manager]。Editors + authoring agents：子流程 Editing and HCI validation [content-author]。Validation and QA（机械 + 智能体）：服务任务 Integration test and QA sweep [content-test]。Publication manager：子流程 Draft, review and publish [content-publish]。Review team and SMEs：Triage published feedback [content-feedback]。再次回到 Work plan：File feedback as beans [todo-manager]。Programme manager：网关“More content?”——“是”循环回编辑阶段；“否”通向 Retire or archive [content-retire] 及结束事件 Folio retired。方括号中的名称为该任务所运行的技能。",
